From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josip Seketa <josip.seketa@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:33:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 53/65] gdb/record-full: replay pseudo registers from a
 restored record too

Replaying a restored record with a ymm register entry said "Selected thread is running"; record_full_is_replaying missed the record-core target.

diff --git a/gdb/record-full.c b/gdb/record-full.c
index ea96dd11a64..a6cece9ce4f 100644
--- a/gdb/record-full.c
+++ b/gdb/record-full.c
@@ -665,7 +665,7 @@ record_full_is_used (void)
 bool
 record_full_is_replaying ()
 {
-  auto target = dynamic_cast<record_full_target *>
+  auto target = dynamic_cast<record_full_base_target *>
 		  (current_inferior ()->target_at (record_stratum));
   return target != nullptr && RECORD_FULL_IS_REPLAY;
 }
